  \resources\OptInMSASearchDescriptionText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kite koe i tae atu ki te 30 rā o ngā rapu i te rainawā, ka nui atu hoki ngā mea ka taea e koe i waenga i ngā pūrere ina takiuru koe mā tētahi pūkete Microsoft.
  \resources\OptInMSADescriptionText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kite koe i tae atu ki te 30 rā i roto i te rainawā, me tō āhei kia mahi mea i ētahi atu mea i waenga i ngā pūrere ki te takiuru koe mā tētahi pūkete Microsoft.
  \resources\OptInMSAAndActivityUploadSearchDescriptionText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kite koe tae atu ki te 30 rā o ngā hua rapu i te rainawā, ka taea hoki te mahi i ētahi atu mahi i waenga i ngā pūrere ki te takiuru koe mā tētahi pūkete Microsoft, me te kōwhiri kia tuku i ō hītori ngohe ki Microsoft, tae atu ki ētahi mōhiohio mō ngā pae tukutuku ka tirohia e koe, he pēhea hoki tō whakamahi i ngā taupānga me ngā ratonga.
  \resources\OptInMSAAndActivityUploadLegalText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hei ako anō mō te āhua o te whakamahi a ngā hua Microsoft me ngā ratonga i tēnei raraunga ki te whakawhaiaro ngā wheako me te pare i tō tūmataitinga, tirohia tēnei e whai ake nei:
  \resources\OptInMSAAndActivityUploadHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tiro ki ētahi atu rā i rainawā
  \resources\OptInMSAAndActivityUploadDescriptionText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kite koe tae atu ki te 30 rā i te rainawā, ka taea hoki te mahi i ētahi atu mahi i waenga i ngā pūrere ki te takiuru koe mā tētahi pūkete Microsoft, me te kōwhiri kia tuku i ō hītori ngohe ki Microsoft, tae atu ki ētahi mōhiohio mō ngā pae tukutuku ka tirohia e koe, he pēhea hoki tō whakamahi i ngā taupānga me ngā ratonga.
  \resources\OptInActivityUploadSearchDescriptionText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kite koe tae atu ki te 30 rā  ngā hua rapu i te rainawā, ka taea hoki te mahi i ētahi atu mahi i waenga i ngā pūrere ki te kōwhiri koe kia tuku i ō hītori ngohe ki Microsoft, tae atu ki ētahi mōhiohio mō ngā pae tukutuku ka tirohia e koe, he pēhea hoki tō whakamahi i ngā taupānga me ngā ratonga.
  \resources\OptInActivityUploadHeaderEnterpriseSkuText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tirohia ō ngohe i ō pūrere katoa
  \resources\OptInActivityUploadDescriptionText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kite koe tae atu ki te 30 rā i te rainawā, ka taea hoki te mahi i ētahi atu mahi i waenga i ngā pūrere ki te kōwhiri koe kia tuku i ō hītori ngohe ki Microsoft, tae atu ki ētahi mōhiohio mō ngā pae tukutuku ka tirohia e koe, he pēhea hoki tō whakamahi i ngā taupānga me ngā ratonga.
  \resources\OptInActivityUploadDescriptionForEnterpriseSkuText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kite koe tae atu ki te 30 rā i te rainawā, ka taea hoki te mahi i ētahi atu mahi i waenga i ngā pūrere ki te kōwhiri koe kia tuku i ō hītori ngohe ki Microsoft, tae atu ki ētahi mōhiohio mō ngā pae tukutuku ka tirohia e koe, he pēhea hoki tō whakamahi i ngā taupānga me ngā ratonga.
